# OIDC tools. Requires the `oidc` configuration (see example.fantocci.yaml / .env.example)
# and a real access token from your identity provider.
@host = localhost:3000
@token = paste.your.token

### Decode the token
GET http://{{host}}/oidc/jwt
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Introspect it at the provider
GET http://{{host}}/oidc/introspect
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### UserInfo
GET http://{{host}}/oidc/userinfo
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Using the custom token header (when oidc.tokenHeader = x-auth-token)
GET http://{{host}}/oidc/introspect
x-auth-token: {{token}}
